==Checkpoint System==
As of [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], clearing certain floors will allow to start Heavenly Tower further than usual on subsequent appearances. Floors before the new start point are still playable with rewards reset.
*Completing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]] allows the player to start on [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 11|Floor 11]] on the following appearance.
*Completing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] allows the player to start on [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 21|Floor 21]] on the following appearance.
*Completing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] allows the player to start on [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 31|Floor 31]] on the following appearance.
*Completing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]] allows the player to start on [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 41|Floor 41]] on the following appearance.

